{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/5XCGVMTGNI3CSHGudu5kMQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:24.469995+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/5XCGVMTGNI3CSHGudu5kMQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hv8m29V2RqZtHlUP0iawGe7NE5vxhyjLWzJMtasbhghWKqbEibJKJHohqbuK0Rw8TD0gnhr5PomFMr9rgcIrFfJA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span>天津大学智慧物联实验室2025年导师团招生现已正式启动，现面向</span><strong><span>2022级（目前大三）具备推免资格的优秀本科生</span></strong><span>开放简历投递通道。欢迎对智慧物联网、大数据等前沿领域充满热情，具备扎实专业基础与学术潜力的计算机、数学、通信等相关专业同学加入智慧物联大家庭，共同探索智能世界的无限可能。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span>实验室主页：https://smartiotlab.net</span></section><section><span>智算学部官网：https://cic.tju.edu.cn</span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>实验室简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>天津大学智慧物联实验室长期专注于工业物联网与工业大数据研究，科研实力雄厚。团队目前拥有国家杰青1人，教授2人，青年长江学者1人，天津市131人才2人，博士、硕士及本科生50余人，富有活力和凝聚力。</span></p><p><span>近五年来，智慧物联研究团队荣获了天津市科技进步一等奖（2022年），获得国家杰青基金、联合重点项目、重点研发计划、工信部重点项目、面上项目等国家级重大重点项目的资助。</span><span><span>发表高水平学术论文400余篇，包含CCF A类，IEEE Trans，中科院一区论文200余篇；撰写专业教材3部，单本发行34000册；出版国际上首部介绍物联网拓扑鲁棒性学术专著1部；授权国家发明专利53余项，其中国际专利2件，软件著作权22件。团队搭建了工业物联网综合感知平台，并与头部企业和行业重点企业（如华为、新华三、国家电网、滴滴等）联合进行产学研研究与人才培养，积极探索研究成果落地应用与转化。</span></span></p><p><span>累计培养国家奖学金5人次，培养CSC留学基金获得者6人次，智算杰出青年2人次。成员获天津市三好学生奖，谭旭光校友奖学金，天津大学优秀学生标兵等若干奖项30余项。实验室硕士毕业生主要就业去向包括腾讯、华为、百度、字节等互联网企业，以及海康威视、中国银行等国企和研究所。博士毕业生任职于天津大学、香港城市大学、东北大学、大连理工大学等高校，以及鹏城实验室、山东省计算中心等单位。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>什么是导师团招生</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>导师团招生是天津大学智能与计算学部选拔优秀保研生的重要方式。该方式为实验室提供了招生自主权，</span><strong><span>学生通过导师团考察后，即可获得录取资格</span></strong><span>。未通过导师团考察的同学仍可于九月参与智算学部统一组织的预推免选拔。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>什么是特招直博生</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>特招直博生由导师团进行综合面试，全面考察专业技能、数学、沟通及抗压等核心素质；学术大牛担任导师，按照CCF优博目标培养。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>导师团有什么优势 </span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）导师团高度自主录取，无需参加院级面试考核；</span></p><p><span>（2）多个前沿方向任意挑选，获得毕设指导，提前开展科研；</span></p><p><span>（3）一流的软硬件条件，丰厚的奖学金及补助；</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>导师团报名要求 </span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）本科毕业学校为一流大学建设高校（涵盖985高校）或所学专业所类属的学科在第四轮全国高校学科评估结果中列A-档及以上的高校（如西安电子科技大学）。</span></p><p><span>（2）预计能够获得所在学校的保研名额。</span></p><p><span>不满足条件1的同学可以报名天津大学智能与计算学部的推免招生，具体要求见天大研招网。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>报名方式</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>请有意向的同学将简历和相关证明材料打包，按照“本科学校_姓名_专业_成绩排名（排名_专业人数）_导师团”格式命名发送至smartiotlab.tju@gmail.com，并抄送 qiutie@tju.edu.cn。</span></p><p><span>如“XX大学_张三_计算机科学与技术_（1_50）_导师团”，该排名为学业成绩排名，综合排名请在简历中体现。</span></p></section></section></section>